.TH "REPROCTL\-OPENCODE" "1" "2026" "reproctl" "Repro Development Tools"
.SH NAME
reproctl\-opencode \- launch OpenCode with an optional model profile
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]reproctl opencode\f[R] [\f[B]\-\-profile\f[R] \f[I]name\f[R]]
[\f[I]opencode\-args...\f[R]]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Launch OpenCode, optionally activating a model profile that overrides
the \f[B]model\f[R] field for each agent without editing the agent
definition files in \f[B].opencode/agents/\f[R].
.PP
When \f[B]\-\-profile\f[R] is given, the matching
\f[B].opencode/profiles/\f[R]_name_\f[B].json\f[R] file is passed to
OpenCode via the \f[B]OPENCODE_CONFIG\f[R] environment variable.
OpenCode merges this config with its own defaults, so only the fields
present in the profile file are overridden.
.PP
On macOS, the launch is wrapped in \f[B]caffeinate \-dims\f[R] to
prevent display sleep, idle sleep, and disk sleep during long agent
sessions.
On other platforms, OpenCode is launched directly.
.PP
Profile files are committed and live at
\f[B].opencode/profiles/\f[R]_name_\f[B].json\f[R].
The \f[B]github\-copilot\-sonnet\f[R] profile documents the canonical
model configuration.
The \f[B]openrouter\-glm5\-minimax\f[R] profile remaps agents to
GLM\-5.1 and MiniMax M2.7 via OpenRouter.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\f[B]\-\-profile\f[R] \f[I]name\f[R]
Activate the profile at
\f[B].opencode/profiles/\f[R]_name_\f[B].json\f[R].
Exits with an error if the profile file does not exist.
.TP
\f[B]\-h\f[R], \f[B]\-\-help\f[R]
Show usage.
.SH PROFILES
Profile files are valid \f[B]opencode.json\f[R] fragments that override
\f[CR]agent.<name>.model\f[R] for one or more named agents.
Only the keys present in the profile are applied; other agent settings
remain unchanged.
.PP
Current profiles:
.TP
\f[B]github\-copilot\-sonnet\f[R]
Mirrors the models hardcoded in the agent files (all five agents use
\f[B]github\-copilot/claude\-sonnet\-4.6\f[R]).
.TP
\f[B]openrouter\-glm5\-minimax\f[R]
Remaps agents to \f[B]openrouter/z\-ai/glm\-5.1\f[R] (planner, review)
and \f[B]openrouter/minimax/minimax\-m2.7\f[R] (develop, test, release)
via OpenRouter.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
reproctl opencode
Launch OpenCode with no profile override.
.TP
reproctl opencode \-\-profile openrouter\-glm5\-minimax
Launch OpenCode with GLM\-5.1 and MiniMax M2.7 via OpenRouter.
.TP
reproctl opencode \-\-profile github\-copilot\-sonnet run \(dqdo the thing\(dq
Launch OpenCode with the GitHub Copilot Sonnet profile and pass a run
command through to opencode.
.TP
reproctl opencode \-\-profile nonexistent
Exits with an error listing available profiles.
.SH SEE ALSO
\f[B]reproctl\f[R](1), \f[B]opencode\f[R](1)
